Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 13:23:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Silksong pad catches up with the fork's slim-149 batch:
 seats, D-pad pitch, glass glyphs, bag Y key

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: Code half of the Silksong pad catch-up with the nxnative fork's slim-149 batch: Needolin and Clawline seats swapped, title D-pad centres 110 apart, glass glyphs at one height with the - / + signs at 0.525, and the backpack crest page's Y key (its art is the companion art patch)
Issue: Tiaoge-tou/NX2Apple PROJECT.md Phase 4

